  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The MRC Unit The Gambia (MRCG) is the MRC&#x2019;s single largest investment in medical research in a low and middle income country. Research including viral disease, maternal and neonatal health, early child development and Nutrition including the evaluation of interventions for the control of diseases of public health importance within The Gambia</narrative>
  </description>
